  <h2>Notice and repair errors</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="makes" data-hint="After doesn’t, the main verb returns to the base form." data-fix="She doesn’t make dinner on Fridays." data-why="Doesn’t already carries the third-person marker, so a second marker on makes is not possible." data-success-message="Correct. You removed the doubled third-person marker after doesn’t.">
